{"seq":2,"slug":"throughput-units","title":"吞吐量：QPS/RPS/TPS 与并发数的辨析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/core-metrics-map/request-metrics/throughput-units","wordCount":2726,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"吞吐量-qps-rps-tps-与并发数的辨析\">吞吐量：QPS/RPS/TPS 与并发数的辨析</h1><p>「我们的系统能扛 5 万 QPS」这句话几乎从来不完整。是峰值还是均值？是单接口还是全站总和？是入口网关的计数还是数据库的实际执行次数？更关键的是——在这 5 万 QPS 下，并发处理中的请求有多少个？延迟是多少？这三个问题的答案互相锁定：在同一个系统里，吞吐、并发与延迟被 Little&#39;s Law 绑成一个等式，改动其中任意两个，第三个自动确定。这也是为什么「提高并发数来提升 QPS」这种直觉经常失败——它没有改变单请求耗时，而单请求耗时才是那个等式里真正的约束。本篇辨析 QPS/RPS/TPS 三个词的实际含义差异，推导吞吐与并发的关系，并说明缓冲与队列如何制造出「吞吐达标但延迟失控」的局面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三个缩写词在日常使用中被大量混用，但在需要精确沟通时它们的差异是实质性的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>计量对象</th>\n<th>典型计数点</th>\n<th>与业务的对齐度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>QPS</td>\n<td>Queries Per Second</td>\n<td>「查询」这个语义单位</td>\n<td>接口入口 / 网关</td>\n<td>取决于「一次查询」的定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RPS</td>\n<td>Requests Per Second</td>\n<td>HTTP 等协议层的请求</td>\n<td>网关、LB、服务端 middleware</td>\n<td>高（可被基础设施直接观测）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TPS</td>\n<td>Transactions Per Second</td>\n<td>一个原子业务事务</td>\n<td>业务逻辑层 / 数据库提交</td>\n<td>最高，但最难统一口径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>差异在于「一次」是多大的一步。一次用户搜索可能对应 1 个 RPS（网关只看到一次 HTTP 请求），但在服务内部扇出到 8 个下游、最终在数据库上产生 30 次查询——如果把这些都算上，就是 QPS = 30；若这次搜索只产生一次数据库提交（比如记录搜索日志），TPS 是 1。<strong>同一个系统在同一秒内可以有 RPS = 1、QPS = 30、TPS = 1。</strong> 因此说「QPS 5 万」时若不说明计数点，这个数字没有意义。</p>\n<p>一个更隐蔽的坑是<strong>采集位置不同导致的系统性差异</strong>。相同流量在以下四个位置计数会得到四个不同的数：CDN/边缘节点（含被缓存的请求）、负载均衡器（含被限流的请求）、服务端 middleware（真实进入业务逻辑的请求）、下游依赖（含重试）。常见现象是「网关显示 10 万 QPS，服务端只看到 6 万」——差额来自 CDN 命中、连接复用探测、健康检查，以及<strong>重试</strong>。重试尤其危险：它让上游 QPS 与下游 QPS 脱钩，且在下游已经过载时进一步加压，形成正反馈。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[客户端请求] --&gt; B[CDN / 边缘]&#10;    B --&gt;|缓存命中 ~35%| C[直接返回, 不计入源站]&#10;    B --&gt;|回源| D[负载均衡]&#10;    D --&gt;|健康检查/探活| E[丢弃, 计入? 否]&#10;    D --&gt; F[服务端 middleware&lt;br/&gt;RPS 计数点]&#10;    F --&gt; G[业务逻辑]&#10;    G --&gt; H[下游扇出 x8&lt;br/&gt;QPS 计数点]&#10;    G --&gt; I[数据库]&#10;    I --&gt;|重试 1.08x| I&#10;    I --&gt; J[日志提交&lt;br/&gt;TPS 计数点]&#10;    H --&gt; K[响应返回]&#10;    J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n    A[客户端请求] --&gt; B[CDN / 边缘]\n    B --&gt;|缓存命中 ~35%| C[直接返回, 不计入源站]\n    B --&gt;|回源| D[负载均衡]\n    D --&gt;|健康检查/探活| E[丢弃, 计入? 否]\n    D --&gt; F[服务端 middleware&lt;br/&gt;RPS 计数点]\n    F --&gt; G[业务逻辑]\n    G --&gt; H[下游扇出 x8&lt;br/&gt;QPS 计数点]\n    G --&gt; I[数据库]\n    I --&gt;|重试 1.08x| I\n    I --&gt; J[日志提交&lt;br/&gt;TPS 计数点]\n    H --&gt; K[响应返回]\n    J --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"little-s-law-吞吐-并发与延迟的恒等式\">Little&#39;s Law：吞吐、并发与延迟的恒等式</h2><p>这三者的关系由 Little&#39;s Law 给出，它是排队论里少数不需要任何分布假设就成立的结论：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\cdot W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是系统中的平均请求数（即并发数），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是到达率（吞吐量），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是请求在系统中的平均停留时间（延迟）。量纲上非常直观：每秒进来 1000 个请求、每个停留 0.05 秒，那么平均就有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000 \\times 0.05 = 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 个请求同时在系统内。</p>\n<p>这个等式有三条实用推论，每一条都对应一类常见的误判。</p>\n<p><strong>推论一：并发数不是可以独立调的旋钮。</strong> 如果你把并发数从 50 提到 200，而单请求处理时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 不变，吞吐理论上涨 4 倍。但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 不可能真的不变——增加并发意味着更多请求同时在竞争 CPU、内存带宽、连接池、锁，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 必然上升。最终落在哪个点上由系统的服务能力决定，而不是由你设定的并发数决定。这就是「线程池调大了 QPS 反而降了」的机制：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 的上升吃掉了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的增益，甚至更多。</p>\n<p><strong>推论二：吞吐有上限，上限由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 决定。</strong> 若系统有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 个可并行处理的资源（线程、连接、CPU 核），且每个请求占用一个资源 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 秒，则最大吞吐是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{max} = C / W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>（忽略排队开销）。要提升上限只有两条路：<strong>减少 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></strong>（优化单请求耗时、加缓存、减少下游扇出）或<strong>增加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></strong>（扩容、异步化、增加连接池）。这两条路的成本结构完全不同：前者是工程投入，后者是资本投入。识别当前瓶颈属于哪一类，决定了优化方向——见 <a href=\"../cost-freshness-metrics/efficiency-metrics\">单位成本吞吐与资源利用率</a> 中关于扩容与优化的成本对比。</p>\n<p><strong>推论三：延迟低的系统吞吐不一定高。</strong> 一个单请求 1ms 但完全串行的系统，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，吞吐上限 1000 QPS，延迟极低。一个单请求 500ms 但并发 2000 的系统，吞吐 4000 QPS，延迟很高。两者都是「可用」的系统，只是服务不同场景。这解释了为什么批处理系统与在线服务不能用同一套指标评价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并发数的两种含义-无缓冲与有队列\">并发数的两种含义：无缓冲与有队列</h2><p>「并发数 200」在不同架构下是完全不同的东西，混用会直接导致容量估算错误。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>并发数含义</th>\n<th>超出上限时行为</th>\n<th>典型实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无缓冲（拒绝式）</td>\n<td>同时在处理的请求数上限</td>\n<td>立即拒绝（429 / 503）</td>\n<td>固定线程池、信号量、连接数上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有队列（缓冲式）</td>\n<td>正在处理数 + 队列中等待数</td>\n<td>排队，延迟上升；队列满后拒绝</td>\n<td>消息队列、Redis list、Kafka、Tomcat accept 队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应（限流式）</td>\n<td>根据延迟/成功率动态调整</td>\n<td>提前拒绝以保护自身</td>\n<td>并发限流器（如 Netflix concurrency-limits 思路）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在<strong>无缓冲</strong>系统里，Little&#39;s Law 直接成立且并发数受硬约束：一旦并发达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，新请求立刻被拒，此时延迟稳定在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，吞吐稳定在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C/W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>——系统有一个干净的工作点。</p>\n<p>在<strong>有队列</strong>系统里，情况糟糕得多。队列的存在使得系统可以接受超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的并发：多余请求进入队列等待，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 包含等待者，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 包含等待时间。表面上吞吐没有下降（甚至因为队列填满而看起来「满负荷」），但延迟在持续上升。这里的关键结论是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{queue} \\approx \\frac{\\rho}{1 - \\rho} \\cdot W_{service}, \\quad \\rho = \\frac{\\lambda}{\\lambda_{max}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">ser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 是利用率。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 时排队时间约等于服务时间的 1 倍；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> 时是 4 倍；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span> 时是 9 倍；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span></span></span></span></span> 时是 19 倍。<strong>这就是利用率的拐点：从 80% 到 95%，吞吐只涨了不到 19%，排队延迟涨了近 5 倍。</strong> 这个非线性关系是饱和度的核心，其工程含义在 <a href=\"saturation-errors\">饱和度与错误率：系统还能撑多久</a> 中有完整展开。</p>\n<p>队列还引入一个更恶劣的性质：<strong>它把过载转化为延迟，从而让上游的重试进一步加重过载</strong>。上游超时（假设 1s）触发重试时，队列里的请求仍在排队，重试的请求又进入队列末尾——有效到达率变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda(1 + r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是重试率，系统离崩溃更近一步。这是级联故障的标准剧本：不是流量涨了 50%，而是重试把 50% 放大成了 125%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"吞吐的正确度量与压力测试口径\">吞吐的正确度量与压力测试口径</h2><p>度量吞吐时有几个必须明确的参数，缺一个数字就不可比。</p>\n<p><strong>口径一：峰值 vs 均值。</strong> 电商搜索的 QPS 曲线通常有 5–10 倍的峰谷比（大促日可达数十倍）。报告「均值 5 万 QPS」时，峰值可能是 30 万。容量规划看峰值，成本核算看均值。</p>\n<p><strong>口径二：是否包含错误响应。</strong> 一个返回 500 的请求同样消耗了服务端资源。若吞吐只统计 2xx，会在故障期间得到一个「吞吐下降」的假象，实际是资源被浪费在失败请求上。正确做法是分别报告<strong>成功吞吐</strong>与<strong>总吞吐</strong>，二者之差就是错误率（见 <a href=\"saturation-errors\">饱和度与错误率：系统还能撑多久</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>口径三：时间窗口与聚合方式。</strong> 按 1 分钟求平均会把 5 秒级的尖峰削平。对于秒杀类场景，必须用秒级甚至 100ms 级窗口观测。Prometheus 的 <code>rate()</code> 在窗口内的样本数不足时会给出误导性的结果（窗口内少于 2 个样本时直接无输出），因此监控窗口的选择本身会影响你看到的吞吐曲线。</p>\n<p><strong>口径四：压测模型的闭环与开环。</strong> 闭环模型（固定并发数，收到响应后立即发下一个）会在系统变慢时自动降低到达率——这是 <a href=\"latency-percentiles\">延迟：平均值为什么骗人，p50/p95/p99 的业务含义</a> 中提到的 coordinated omission 的另一种表现形式。开环模型（按固定到达率发请求，不管响应）才能真实模拟「用户不会因为系统变慢就不来」的线上情况。生产环境的容量验证应当使用开环模型，而闭环模型只适合找单请求耗时。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>压测模型</th>\n<th>到达过程</th>\n<th>系统变慢时</th>\n<th>适合回答</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>闭环 / 固定并发</td>\n<td>依赖响应完成</td>\n<td>自动降速</td>\n<td>这个接口单次要多久</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开环 / 固定到达率</td>\n<td>独立于响应</td>\n<td>队列堆积、延迟爆炸</td>\n<td>这个系统能扛多少流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶梯加压</td>\n<td>逐级提高到达率</td>\n<td>可观测拐点</td>\n<td>拐点在哪、崩溃形态如何</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>阶梯加压是找出系统拐点的标准方法：逐步提高到达率，观察吞吐与延迟的分离点——吞吐停止增长而延迟继续上升的那一刻，就是饱和点。这个拐点的存在性由排队论保证，与具体实现无关。拐点的识别与利用见 <a href=\"saturation-errors\">饱和度与错误率：系统还能撑多久</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>QPS/RPS/TPS 的差异在于「一次」是多大的一步；不说明计数点，吞吐数字不可比。</li>\n<li>采集位置决定数字：CDN、LB、middleware、下游四个位置对同一流量给出四个不同的值，重试是主要偏差来源。</li>\n<li>Little&#39;s Law <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 恒成立且无分布假设：并发、吞吐、延迟三者只能任选其二。</li>\n<li>并发数不是独立旋钮；提高并发会推高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，增益可能被完全吃掉。</li>\n<li>无缓冲系统有干净的工作点（拒绝式保护）；有队列系统用延迟换吞吐，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 超过 0.8 后排队时间非线性爆炸。</li>\n<li>队列把过载转成延迟，进而触发上游重试，形成级联故障；有效到达率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda(1+r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>吞吐度量必须明确峰值/均值、是否含错误响应、时间窗口，压测必须区分闭环与开环模型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"吞吐量：QPS/RPS/TPS 与并发数的辨析","id":"吞吐量-qps-rps-tps-与并发数的辨析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Little's Law：吞吐、并发与延迟的恒等式","id":"little-s-law-吞吐-并发与延迟的恒等式"},{"level":2,"text":"并发数的两种含义：无缓冲与有队列","id":"并发数的两种含义-无缓冲与有队列"},{"level":2,"text":"吞吐的正确度量与压力测试口径","id":"吞吐的正确度量与压力测试口径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"延迟：平均值为什么骗人，p50/p95/p99 的业务含义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/core-metrics-map/request-metrics/latency-percentiles"},"next":{"title":"饱和度与错误率：系统还能撑多久","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/core-metrics-map/request-metrics/saturation-errors"}}